  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICRC operations by the Pretoria (regional) Delegation(2024 Unaudited)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The ICRC&apos;s Pretoria delegation monitors the humanitarian situation, promotes international humanitarian law, restores contact between family members separated by conflict and helps National Societies enhance their emergency-response capabilities. The ICRC&apos;s Harare delegation promotes detainee welfare, supports health services and mine action, restores family links, works with Red Cross Societies and promotes international humanitarian law and the work of the ICRC.</narrative>
  </description>
